              "text": "frāternus, frāterna, frāternum — \"brotherly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Amor frāternus semper manet. Brotherly love always endures."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From frāter. English fraternal."
            }
          ]
        },
